llback, and evidence currency\n\n## Frozen findings\n\nThe current continuity candidate is T9 with facility map F6, load plan G4, route map R8, staffing roster L11, and message release C7. Evidence for T8 is historical unless explicitly transferred and rechecked.\nRollback to T8 is mechanically possible only while facility roster F5 and route table R7 remain compatible. Mechanical possibility is not authorization.\nEvery mutation must record before and after candidate hashes, changed artifacts, affected evidence, check currency, owner, and rollback effect.\n\n## Governing relationships\n\nCLIMATE, GRID, WATER, CLINIC, SHELTER, TRANSIT, COMMS, and LABOR observations may become stale after LINEAGE mutations.\nREVIEW evaluates current-candidate evidence independently; COUNCIL authorizes operation and closure separately.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| LIN-000 | facility-map | v3 | 9.0 | candidate-index | superseded |\n| LIN-001 | load-plan | v3 | 10.7 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-002 | route-map | v3 | 9.5 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-003 | message-release | v3 | 11.2 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-004 | facility-map | v3 | 10.0 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-005 | load-plan | v3 | 11.7 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-006 | route-map | v3 | 10.5 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-007 | message-release | v3 | 9.3 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-008 | facility-map | v3 | 11.0 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-009 | load-plan | v3 | 9.8 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-010 | route-map | v3 | 11.5 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-011 | message-release | v3 | 10.3 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-012 | facility-map | v3 | 9.1 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-013 | load-plan | v4 | 10.8 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-014 | route-map | v4 | 9.6 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-015 | message-release | v4 | 11.3 | candidat